1. Problem Statement
Design a scalable Order Processing Microservices System using Java 17, Spring Boot, Kafka, and REST APIs. The system should support asynchronous order processing, inventory validation, payment handling, notifications, failure recovery, and scalable deployment.

The main goal is to build an event-driven architecture where services communicate through Kafka topics to reduce tight coupling and improve scalability.

